#: ../../tools/remote/expert_feedback.md:1 8d3c24d272f5440dbd96c8b55b5a0ef6
msgid "Human Expert Feedback System"
msgstr "人工专家反馈系统"

#: ../../tools/remote/expert_feedback.md:2 4ad6e56470a94ad89e3b8d2453090add
msgid "![Web UI](ui.jpg)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/remote/expert_feedback.md:2 dc4e9006f81640f18c6998fb85c87568
msgid "Web UI"
msgstr "Web 用户界面"

#: ../../tools/remote/expert_feedback.md:3 cb3cde6b8aa74d669459a540b7e7269d
msgid "📖 Overview"
msgstr "📖 概述"

#: ../../tools/remote/expert_feedback.md:5 89ccfab3ce534dd792f4fd46e833e24e
msgid ""
"The Human Expert Feedback System is a sophisticated **human-in-the-loop**"
" consultation platform designed for ToolUniverse. It enables AI systems "
"to seamlessly consult with human experts when encountering complex "
"decisions, particularly in medical and scientific domains where expert "
"knowledge is crucial."
msgstr "人体专家反馈系统是一款为ToolUniverse设计的先进**人机协同**咨询平台。该系统使人工智能在面对复杂决策时，能够无缝地与人体专家进行咨询，尤其适用于医学和科学领域，这些领域对专家知识有着极高的依赖。"

#: ../../tools/remote/expert_feedback.md:7 dbb9d568b045472fad0ea3352d62c901
msgid "🎯 Key Capabilities"
msgstr "🎯 关键能力"

#: ../../tools/remote/expert_feedback.md:9 595a6fdbf0604528a065f6ae300b55da
msgid ""
"**🔄 Real-time Consultation**: Submit questions to human experts and "
"receive responses in real-time"
msgstr "**🔄 实时咨询**：向人工专家提交问题，实时获取回复"

#: ../../tools/remote/expert_feedback.md:10 719c16e6d04b42beb43be798f99aacd6
msgid ""
"**🌐 Modern Web Interface**: Beautiful, responsive dashboard with auto-"
"refresh for expert interactions"
msgstr "**🌐 现代网页界面**：美观且响应迅速的仪表盘，支持自动刷新以优化专家交互体验"

#: ../../tools/remote/expert_feedback.md:11 5c216be7fef249c1a31e24062850bfaf
msgid ""
"**⚡ MCP Integration**: Built on Model Context Protocol for seamless "
"ToolUniverse integration"
msgstr "**⚡ MCP 集成**：基于模型上下文协议构建，实现与 ToolUniverse 的无缝集成"

#: ../../tools/remote/expert_feedback.md:12 a268be5102ad4420ae6f200d08229c52
msgid ""
"**🎨 Priority Management**: Support for normal, high, and urgent priority "
"requests with visual indicators"
msgstr "**🎨 优先级管理**：支持普通、高优先级及紧急请求，并配有视觉指示器"

#: ../../tools/remote/expert_feedback.md:13 63e9e7ae0e3b4ba39ba00baf751b4400
msgid ""
"**📱 Multi-Interface**: Web-based and terminal-based interfaces for "
"different user preferences"
msgstr "**📱 多接口**：基于网页和终端的接口，满足不同用户偏好"

#: ../../tools/remote/expert_feedback.md:14 2f9d4191eedb47cbaac0da685f5f911e
msgid ""
"**🔌 Flexible Deployment**: Auto-port discovery and custom configuration "
"options"
msgstr "**🔌 灵活部署**：自动端口发现与自定义配置选项"

#: ../../tools/remote/expert_feedback.md:16 4b5e8dfcc88a47188471ab4eb90089b0
msgid "🩺 Use Cases"
msgstr "🩺 使用案例"

#: ../../tools/remote/expert_feedback.md:18 35481625410541038941d529317dd845
msgid "**Medical AI**: Get expert medical opinions for complex patient cases"
msgstr "**医疗AI**：为复杂患者病例提供专家医疗意见"

#: ../../tools/remote/expert_feedback.md:19 f4af5c0813ca4e0ba19dccedef5421f7
msgid ""
"**Scientific Research**: Consult domain experts for research methodology "
"and analysis"
msgstr "**科学研究**：请咨询领域专家以获取研究方法和分析"

#: ../../tools/remote/expert_feedback.md:20 c27b9f7c92b042a19a94c80a5273135d
msgid ""
"**Drug Discovery**: Expert review of molecular compounds and drug "
"interactions"
msgstr "**药物发现**：分子化合物与药物相互作用的专家评审"

#: ../../tools/remote/expert_feedback.md:21 2a24c6f5690b4416bbe3405c81d44ae0
msgid ""
"**Clinical Decision Support**: Real-time consultation for treatment "
"recommendations"
msgstr "**临床决策支持**：实时咨询以提供治疗建议"

#: ../../tools/remote/expert_feedback.md:22 3c7e09ed67364e4da1977b1021305233
msgid ""
"**Research Validation**: Expert validation of AI-generated hypotheses and"
" findings"
msgstr "**研究验证**：专家对人工智能生成的假设和发现进行验证"

#: ../../tools/remote/expert_feedback.md:24 53af6ff6463c4799aeefcb1036e71740
msgid "image"
msgstr "图像"

